# Bolas's Citadel lets the top card of the library be cast for life equal to its mana value rather than its mana cost - an
# alternative cost of its own, so no other may be paid with it (CR 118.9a; the ruling: no alternative costs such as bestow).
# Springheart Nantuko on top is never offered bestowed, though Bot1 has the mana for its bestow cost and a creature to
# enchant (CR 702.103a); it is cast as the creature for 2 life.

